tasks.description:
在 app/models/ 目录下创建 Note 模型。修改 app/models/__init__.py 添加导入。模型字段: id, title, content, created_at。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at}]
- GET /notes/<id> -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- PUT /notes/<id> (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/<id> -> {message: str}

在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 路由文件，提供笔记的 CRUD API。需要在 app/__init__.py 注册 notes_bp 蓝图。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at}]
- GET /notes/<id> -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- PUT /notes/<id> (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/<id> -> {message: str}

在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 前端页面，用于显示和管理笔记。需要在 app/__init__.py 添加路由来显示这个页面（如 @app.route('/notes')）。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at}]
- GET /notes/<id> -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- PUT /notes/<id> (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at}
- DELETE /notes/<id> -> {message: str}

在 app/routes/notes.py 中实现搜索功能，支持通过标题或内容关键字搜索笔记。需要更新 API 路由以支持查询参数。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
